Error [jet.UnknownArgumentLabel]: `print` has no parameter labelled `sep`
  --> tests/ui/print_unknown_label.jet:2:21
    |
  2 |     print("a", "b", sep: "-")
    |                     ^^^
 Why: A label binds an argument to the parameter of that name
 Fix: `print` takes no labelled arguments
